  "title": "Mitigate software supply chain risks in Github Actions",
  "description": "GitHub Actions workflows are a prime target for supply chain attacks—from malicious pull requests exfiltrating secrets to compromised dependencies and hijacked tags. In this 15-minute session, we'll walk through practical, high-impact strategies to protect your CI/CD pipelines, including how to inspect repos for hidden risks, shrink your attack surface, and lock down what your workflows can actually do. Leave with a concrete checklist to harden your workflows today. Stay safe!",
